### ================================================================================
### SUITE DE PRUEBAS MANUALES HTTP - GATEWAY NODE.JS (PUERTO 7300)
### Normativa: ASBANC FTR / YAPAGO V47
### Requisito: Iniciar servicio Node.js con `npm run dev`
### ================================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7300
@clientId = asbanc_ftr
@clientSecret = asbanc_ftr_secret_2026
@validStudentCode = 201820005
@nonExistentStudentCode = 99999999
@invalidStudentCode = ABC-INVALID

### ================================================================================
### 0. AUTENTICACION OAUTH 2.0 / JWT (PAGINA 8 GUIA V47)
### ================================================================================

# @name auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{clientId}}",
  "client_secret": "{{clientSecret}}"
}

### Guardar token obtenido para las siguientes peticiones
@authToken = {{auth.response.body.access_token}}

### ================================================================================
### 1. HEALTHCHECK Y TELEMETRIA PROMETHEUS
### ================================================================================

### 1.1 Estado del Servicio (Healthcheck)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1.2 Metricas Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### ================================================================================
### 2. PRUEBA DE VALIDACION DE CLIENTE (VALIDATE CUSTOMER)
### ================================================================================

### 2.1 Validar Cliente Existente con Bearer Token (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "VAL-001-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 2.2 Validar Cliente con Cabecera "Basic <token>" (Especificacion Oficial V47 Pág. 33)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "VAL-BASIC-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 2.3 Validar Cliente con Telemetria Query ?metrics=true (Inyeccion de tiempo de ejecucion)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer?metrics=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "VAL-METRIC-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 2.4 Validar Cliente Inexistente (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 16 - CLIENTE NO EXISTE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "VAL-INEX-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{nonExistentStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 2.5 Validar Formato Invalido (Error 99 / Error de Validacion de Esquema Zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoCliente": "123"
}

### ================================================================================
### 3. PRUEBA DE CONSULTA DE DEUDAS (LIST DEBTS)
### ================================================================================

### 3.1 Consultar Deudas de Estudiante con Cuotas Pendientes (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 00)
# @name listDebts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ListDebts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "DEB-001-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### Variables extraidas de la primera deuda encontrada
@numDocumento = {{listDebts.response.body.deudasPendientes[0].numDocumento}}
@importeDeuda = {{listDebts.response.body.deudasPendientes[0].montoDeuda}}
@numOperacionBanco = TXN-TEST-{{$timestamp}}

### 3.2 Consultar Deudas de Cliente Inexistente (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 16)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ListDebts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "DEB-INEX-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{nonExistentStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### ================================================================================
### 4. PRUEBA DE PAGO DE DEUDA E IDEMPOTENCIA (PAY DEBT)
### ================================================================================

### 4.1 Notificar Pago de Deuda (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 00)
# @name payDebt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/PayDebt
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "PAY-001-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoBanco": "1020",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "numDocumento": "{{numDocumento}}",
  "numOperacionBanco": "{{numOperacionBanco}}",
  "importePagado": {{importeDeuda}},
  "formaPago": "EF",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 4.2 Reintento de Pago (Control de Idempotencia ACID - HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 00)
### Debe retornar el MISMO numOperacionERP sin duplicar el cobro en base de datos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/PayDebt
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "PAY-IDEM-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoBanco": "1020",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "numDocumento": "{{numDocumento}}",
  "numOperacionBanco": "{{numOperacionBanco}}",
  "importePagado": {{importeDeuda}},
  "formaPago": "EF",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### ================================================================================
### 5. PRUEBA DE REVERSION / EXTORNO TRANSACCIONAL (REVERSE PAY)
### ================================================================================

### 5.1 Revertir Pago Realizado (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 00)
### Restaura la deuda al estado pendiente (25) y elimina el registro de pago
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ReversePay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "REV-001-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoBanco": "1020",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "numDocumento": "{{numDocumento}}",
  "numOperacionBanco": "{{numOperacionBanco}}",
  "importePagado": {{importeDeuda}},
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 5.2 Revertir Operacion Inexistente (HTTP 200, codigoRespuesta: 99)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ReversePay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "idConsulta": "REV-INEX-{{$timestamp}}",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoBanco": "1020",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "numDocumento": "{{numDocumento}}",
  "numOperacionBanco": "OP-NON-EXISTENT-99999",
  "importePagado": {{importeDeuda}},
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### ================================================================================
### 6. SEGURIDAD Y CONTROL DE ERRORES BANCARIOS
### ================================================================================

### 6.1 Peticion sin Token de Autenticacion (HTTP 401 con JSON codigoRespuesta: 99)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idConsulta": "UNAUTH-001",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### 6.2 Token Invalido / Falso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Transaction/ValidateCustomer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token_falso_invalido_123456

{
  "idConsulta": "UNAUTH-002",
  "codigoEmpresa": "0001",
  "codigoServicio": "01",
  "codigoAgencia": "001",
  "codigoCanal": "01",
  "codigoCliente": "{{validStudentCode}}",
  "fechaHoraOperacion": "2026-10-11T12:00:00"
}

### ================================================================================
### 7. MODULO OFF-HOST (ARCHIVOS PLANOS FTRCOB Y CONCILIACION)
### ================================================================================

### 7.1 Generar Archivo Plano de Deudas FTRCOB (Cabecera 210 chars / Detalle 178 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/OffHost/GenerateDebts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "tipoActualizacion": "R",
  "secuencia": 1
}

### ================================================================================
### 8. CONSULTA DE AUDITORIA FORENSE
### ================================================================================

### 8.1 Consultar ultimos 10 registros de auditoria transaccional
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Audit?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
